 4.png", "id": "998370546537704", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313074_998370549871037_8277196296727841323_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=41SPpYSTrOkQ7kNvwFtCNJ6&_nc_oc=AdpSX1mq6zVsAg0yo6UIIlfQwSY77tvvRXS-qW-3kPL6U1RBr6AFr2G9L4-np0zp9ZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL9ciwcDkQvwPL7jVrhw41dw86Q9BKRgI3t0GAtYhKXrw&oe=6AB2828F"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5.png", "id": "1060543023135045", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311585_1060543026468378_2590610854450189081_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xzfFmeDdIo4Q7kNvwFpEQT_&_nc_oc=AdprbR9TcgzjuubLdHyNfvOsYoXim8Jz97wvkN3yvT2ne0A3WI9rYvtNtg7pXjKa4Ko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIj4ToF3youRJTlmYSJuq6-FZU_PB9dXcUuF2KjJIPuDg&oe=6AB294EE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hero Cover - Landscape.png", "id": "1677752097360682", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/747795579_1677752100694015_4383076013400415113_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZioNr5nvECQQ7kNvwE0ivhP&_nc_oc=AdoVSKPkXEN5de37rjOy2lIM2sAYMziWc6cUFvUfr5b21DpGWeb1I1lWPN5395HGNiI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIABojDTUp1HYTMG-n21TJwukT9n8L-inCHZ1Fxo1jCtA&oe=6AB2A56B"}, "display_name": "Block 'em Up", "keywords": ["puzzle", "passthrough", "indie", "narrative", "handtracking"], "long_description": "# BLOCK 'EM UP\n*A short, sarcastic spatial puzzle game about cinema, blocks, and emotional survival.*\n\n## WHAT IS THIS GAME?\n\n**Block 'em Up** plays on the double meaning of \"Blocking\":\n\n* **Cinema:** Staging actors and planning movement on set.\n* **Psychology:** Suppressing emotions just to survive the day.\n* **Gameplay:** A hybrid of Beat 'em Up action and spatial AR puzzles in your room.\n\nThe set is a spatial projection of Kira\u2019s mind. Help Kira, a sarcastic stunt actress, navigate her inner chaos by placing Mixed Reality blocks in your real space to clear her path through emotional obstacles.\n\n## DEVELOPER'S NOTE & ROADMAP\n\n**Block 'em Up** is an experimental, bite-sized indie title created by independent studio **Digital Love**. \n\nDesigned as an accessible, short-form XR experience, the game is priced around the cost of a local coffee. Every purchase directly funds ongoing indie development\u2014starting with free updates for *Block 'em Up* and extending to future spatial computing projects.\n\n## VOICE ACTING NOTE \n*The character voices feature AI-generated placeholder audio. As sales grow, the immediate priority is hiring local voice actors from a nearby theatre school to record full studio audio.*\n\n\n## WHAT\u2019S NEXT?\nDevelopment is active! Upcoming updates include:\n* New spatial puzzle mechanics\n* Additional level packs\n* An **\"Extended Footage\"** mini-expansion\n\nThank you for supporting independent XR development!", "short_description": "Place spatial AR blocks in your room to guide Kira\u2014a sarcastic stunt actress\u2014through the emotional chaos of her mind. An indie XR puzzle!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/script-em-up-privacy-policy/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Digital Love", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://digitallove.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"]